er glory. 🚜 What Awaits You in the Demo?4 Hours of Farming Fun: Dive into a solid 4-hour demo experience fu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:02:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691518","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2715880-1846018067934262","game_id":"steam-2715880","kind":"announcement","title":"Farmer's Diary - Devlog #1: Welcome to the Ranch","summary":"Devlog #1: Welcome to the Ranch As we get closer to our demo release, we wanted to share how Farmer's Diary works and what we had in mind while building it. The StoryYou leave your job in the city and come back to your father's ranch. He left you the land and the diary he kept, along with some unpaid bills. The ranch hasn't run properly in years. Your goal is to bring it back to life, pay off the debt, and earn back the town's trust. Along the way, you will interact and reconnect with your fathe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T18:01:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934262","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2715880":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:19:30Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:19:30Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2715880":"2026-10-26T00:19:30Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2715880":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:19:30Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:19:30Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5295160":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:19:30Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:19:30Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-2715880","app_id":2715880,"app_scope":"ba